# Collected/generated, not source: rebuild with `python -m src.Data.run`.
# daily_price.csv alone runs >100MB, over GitHub's per-file limit.
# `/*`, not the directory itself: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded. The three kept files are inputs nothing fetches.
Data/raw file/*
!Data/raw file/sp_500_historical_components.csv
!Data/raw file/monthly_FF5.csv
!Data/raw file/daily_FF5.csv
